@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title s000091_f459979d - System Architecture (LwM2M + Blockchain-backed Management)

actor "Authenticated API Client" as Client

node "Java Backend (Spring)" as Backend {
  component "UserController\n(Protected REST API)" as UserController <<REST>>
  component "UserService" as UserService
  component "JwtUtility\nToken Validator" as JwtUtil <<Security>>
  component "BlockchainIntegrationService\n(Web3j Client)" as BCService <<Web3j>>
  component "ASCII32 Codec\n(32-byte ASCII encode/decode)" as Ascii32 <<Utility>>
  component "LwM2M Service\n(JSON -> Typed Nodes)" as Lwm2mService <<Leshan>>
}

node "Ethereum-compatible Node" as EthNode {
  component "JSON-RPC Endpoint\n(HTTP)" as JsonRpc <<RPC>>
  component "Smart Contract:\nClient/Bootstrap Registry" as Contract <<Contract>>
}

Client --> UserController : HTTP (GET /users, POST /add)\nAuthorization header

UserController --> JwtUtil : Validate token\nC-001: JwtUtility.isValidToken(auth, 1)
UserController --> UserService : Retrieve/Create users\non valid token
UserController <-- UserService : 200 OK / 201 Created\nUser data
UserController ..> Client : 401/403/400 on invalid token\nFR-001/FR-002

BCService --> Ascii32 : Encode/Decode fixed 32-byte fields\nA-004, NFR-004
BCService -down-> JsonRpc : Web3j HTTP transport\nC-002
JsonRpc --> Contract : Invoke contract methods\nC-003

Lwm2mService ..> BCService : Retrieve bootstrap by endpoint\nFR-005
Lwm2mService : Deserialize LwM2M node JSON\nFR-006, NFR-003

note right of UserController
User HTTP API
- FR-001: GET users
- FR-002: POST /add (create user)
Access control:
- 0 -> proceed
- 1 -> 401 Unauthorized
- 2 -> 403 Forbidden
- other -> 400 Bad Request
NFR-001: Enforce token-based access
end note

note right of Contract
Fields (DR-002):
- endpoint
- bootstrap server: url, identity, key
- server: url, identity, key
All strings encoded as fixed 32-byte ASCII
end note

note bottom of BCService
Blockchain-backed operations
- FR-003: Retrieve client/security info
  On contract access failure, record exception
  and return empty collection (no propagate)
- FR-004: Submit client bootstrap (addClient)
  Convert strings to 32-byte ASCII before call
- FR-005: Retrieve bootstrap by endpoint
  Encode endpoint -> 32-byte; decode fields on return
end note

note bottom of Lwm2mService
LwM2M JSON handling (Leshan/LwM2M):
- Deserialize valid JSON -> typed nodes
- Reject invalid payloads (e.g., instances without id)
Mapping (DR-005): boolean->BOOLEAN, string->STRING,
integers lossless->INTEGER, other numbers->FLOAT,
others default->STRING
end note

note top of Backend
Environment:
- Java backend runtime
- Spring MVC controllers (HTTP)
- Leshan/LwM2M model types
Dependencies:
- A-001/A-003: Auth header validation, valid JSON structure
end note

note top of EthNode
Blockchain communication:
- Web3j over HTTP JSON-RPC
- Ethereum-compatible node (NFR-002)
end note
@enduml
